{
  "name": "mn-ws-server",
  "version": "0.7.0",
  "description": "mn-ws server 半：公网侧的 HTTP ⇄ WebSocket 桥",
  "type": "module",
  "private": true,
  "//private": "**这个包不发布到 npm。** server 半是公网机上的服务，它的分发渠道是 **Docker 镜像**（见仓库根的 Dockerfile）—— 一个 npm 包对它没有意义。npm 上的 `mn-ws-server` 停在 0.6.x，0.7.0 起不再更新。",
  "//main": "main/exports 保留：workspace 内的 TS client（client/src/core/bridge.ts）要引 `mn-ws-server/protocol` 与 `mn-ws-server/apps` —— 那份 TS client 半是**交叉兼容测试的对照物**（验证旧版 client 能连新版 server），不是发布物。",
  "main": "./dist/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
  "bin": {
    "mn-ws-server": "./bin/mn-ws-server.exe"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/index.js"
    },
    "./protocol": {
      "types": "./dist/protocol.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/protocol.js"
    },
    "./apps": {
      "types": "./dist/apps.d.ts",
      "import": "./dist/apps.js"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "bin",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node scripts/run-local.mjs",
    "dev": "node --import tsx src/cli.ts",
    "build": "tsc -b tsconfig.json",
    "build:rust": "cargo build --release --manifest-path ../rust/Cargo.toml",
    "build:dist": "pnpm run build:rust && node ../scripts/install-rust-bin.mjs server",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json",
    "test": "node --import tsx --test test/*.test.ts",
    "lint": "eslint ."
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "ws": "^8.18.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.10.0",
    "@types/ws": "^8.5.13",
    "tsx": "^4.19.0",
    "typescript": "~5.9.0"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/On-DevPlan/mn-ws.git",
    "directory": "server"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "websocket",
    "bridge",
    "proxy",
    "nx"
  ]
}
